    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to survive, craft and build the essentials, find source of food and construct necessary shelter before the snow starts falling. And may be someday, after building a bridge, you will find your way back home. Keep building bridges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASIC SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic survival is building a fire for heat and warmth to keep from freezing to death. This is essential for heat as well as for cooking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.poster.avif?t=1752335447\" aria-label=\"character grabbing and combining rock, stick, log to craft a fire\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.webm?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.mp4?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice too the blinking hunger bar with the drumstick icon. It is up to you to explore and find food.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING SHELTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you discover sources of sustainable food you can begin to collect materials for building shelter. Structures help you to keep warm, store food properly, and tan hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.poster.avif?t=1752335447\" aria-label=\"dragging a box to build sections of structures\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.webm?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.mp4?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER SURVIVAL TIPS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protective clothing is important and can be crafted from tanned hides, properly smoking the hides ensures that you get the best protection.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berries are a plentiful source of replenishable food though you should stock up before temperatures get too cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small fur creature roaming around is a little dangerous so be careful wounds can sometimes be fatal. They love the berries and will slowly multiply.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to survive, craft and build the essentials, find source of food and construct necessary shelter before the snow starts falling. And may be someday, after building a bridge, you will find your way back home. Keep building bridges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASIC SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic survival is building a fire for heat and warmth to keep from freezing to death. This is essential for heat as well as for cooking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.poster.avif?t=1752335447\" aria-label=\"character grabbing and combining rock, stick, log to craft a fire\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.webm?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.mp4?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice too the blinking hunger bar with the drumstick icon. It is up to you to explore and find food.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING SHELTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you discover sources of sustainable food you can begin to collect materials for building shelter. Structures help you to keep warm, store food properly, and tan hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.poster.avif?t=1752335447\" aria-label=\"dragging a box to build sections of structures\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.webm?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.mp4?t=1752335447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER SURVIVAL TIPS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protective clothing is important and can be crafted from tanned hides, properly smoking the hides ensures that you get the best protection.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berries are a plentiful source of replenishable food though you should stock up before temperatures get too cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small fur creature roaming around is a little dangerous so be careful wounds can sometimes be fatal. They love the berries and will slowly multiply.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
